"""
portmasterforwarder.core - PortMasterForwarder application logic (no GUI; easy to test and extend).

Everything that touches the SD card goes through here: shortcuts (.sh), gamelist.xml,
screenshots, metadata sources and es_systems_*.cfg files.
Metadata quality rules (genres, gameplay descriptions, ratings) live in portmasterforwarder/meta.py.
Platform specifics (Knulli today) live in PROFILES so other emulation systems can be added.
"""
